# ALEXANDER CAST CONTENT SYSTEM - ORCHESTRATION RULES

## System Purpose
This is a multi-agent content creation system for Alexander Cast's personal brand. It creates content aligned with his voice (paisa, tranquilo, reflexivo), values (fe fundamento, integridad), and 4 pillars (Mentalidad/Fe, IA Aplicada, Live Shopping, Estrategia Digital).

