## Agent Routing

### 1. orchestrator.md
TRIGGER: User request without specific agent mentioned
ROLE: Analyze request → Route to correct agent(s) → Coordinate multi-agent workflows
READS: All core/, determines which agents/skills needed

### 2. strategist.md
TRIGGER: "Plan content", "calendario", "estrategia mensual"
ROLE: Content planning, pillar distribution, calendar creation
REQUIRES: core/ + skills/pillar-distributor.md
OUTPUTS: Weekly/monthly content calendars

### 3. copywriter.md
TRIGGER: "Escribe post", "create caption", "draft copy"
ROLE: Write raw copy using frameworks (AIDA, PAS, Storytelling)
REQUIRES: core/ + skills/viral-hooks.md, skills/storytelling.md
OUTPUTS: Raw copy (NOT final, needs alexander-adapter)

### 4. alexander-adapter.md
TRIGGER: ALWAYS after copywriter.md
ROLE: Transform generic copy into Alexander's authentic voice
REQUIRES: core/voice-dna.md + skills/alexander-voice-adapter.md
OUTPUTS: Final copy in Alexander's voice

### 5. analyst.md
TRIGGER: "Analiza performance", "métricas", "qué funcionó"
ROLE: Analyze content performance, identify patterns, recommend adjustments
REQUIRES: Historical data (if available)
OUTPUTS: Performance reports, insights, recommendations

### 6. visual-director.md
TRIGGER: "Diseño visual", "paleta de colores", "concepto gráfico"
ROLE: Visual concepts, design direction, brand aesthetics
REQUIRES: core/ + knowledge/brand-assets/
OUTPUTS: Visual concepts, moodboards, design specs

### 7. live-shopping-educator.md
TRIGGER: Content about Pilar 3 (Live Shopping)
ROLE: Educational content about live commerce, technical explanations
REQUIRES: core/ + knowledge specific to live shopping
OUTPUTS: Educational frameworks, objection handling, terminology

---

## Skill Usage

### When to Load Skills

**ALWAYS load before first use:**
- Read the relevant skill file
- Apply instructions from skill
- Proceed with task

**Skill combinations (common patterns):**

Pattern 1: WRITE POST
1. skills/viral-hooks.md (create hook options)
2. skills/storytelling.md (if narrative post)
3. agents/copywriter.md (write raw copy)
4. skills/alexander-voice-adapter.md (adapt to voice)
5. agents/alexander-adapter.md (finalize)

Pattern 2: PLAN CALENDAR
1. skills/pillar-distributor.md (balance pillars)
2. skills/referent-researcher.md (check competition)
3. skills/trend-adaptation.md (identify trends)
4. agents/strategist.md (create calendar)

Pattern 3: ANALYZE PERFORMANCE
1. skills/content-analyzer.md (reverse engineer successful posts)
2. agents/analyst.md (metrics + insights)
3. agents/strategist.md (adjust strategy)

Pattern 4: FAITH CONTENT
1. skills/faith-business-integration.md (integration frameworks)
2. skills/storytelling.md (narrative structure)
3. agents/copywriter.md (draft)
4. agents/alexander-adapter.md (voice adaptation)

Pattern 5: KREOON SHOWCASE
1. skills/kreoon-showcase.md (educational frameworks)
2. agents/copywriter.md (write)
3. agents/alexander-adapter.md (ensure 80% education, 20% product)

Pattern 6: DEEP FRAMEWORK
1. knowledge/applied-frameworks.md (consult relevant section)
2. Relevant agent/skill for execution

