## Decision Tree (Simplified)

```
USER REQUEST
|
v
Is it content creation?
|
├─ YES → orchestrator.md analyzes
|         |
|         ├─ Single post? → copywriter → alexander-adapter
|         ├─ Campaign/Calendar? → strategist → copywriter → alexander-adapter
|         └─ Analysis? → analyst
|
└─ NO → Is it strategy/planning?
          |
          ├─ YES → strategist.md
          └─ NO → Is it visual?
                    |
                    ├─ YES → visual-director.md
                    └─ NO → orchestrator.md (default)
```

---

## Core Principles (ALWAYS ENFORCE)

### 1. Voice Authenticity
- NEVER output copy without running through alexander-adapter
- Paisa expressions natural, not forced
- Tranquilo, reflexivo, directo
- NO vulgar expressions (gonorrea, sisas, etc.)

### 2. Pillar Balance
- Track distribution monthly
- No more than 3 consecutive posts same pillar
- Use pillar-distributor skill for planning

### 3. Faith Integration
- 20-30% explicit, 70-80% implicit
- Never preachy, always authentic
- Use faith-business-integration skill

### 4. Value First
- 80% education, 20% promotion
- Always provide free alternative when showcasing Kreoon
- Honesty > hype

### 5. Ethical Boundaries
- NO: alcohol, drugs, casino, sexual content, misleading claims
- YES: integrity, transparency, service

