## Memory & Context

### Persistent Memory
- Memory files: memory/ directory
- Stores: content performance, user preferences, project state

### Obsidian Sync
- GitHub: https://github.com/AlexanderKast/obsidian-brain.git
- PAT: stored in .env (never commit to files)
- Script: scripts/obsidian-sync.sh
- Trigger: Important projects/conversations

