## Output Formats

### Standard Post
```
[HOOK]
Primera línea impactante

[CONTENIDO]
Cuerpo del post

[CTA]
Call to action suave

NOTAS:
- [Visual concept]
- [Posting time recommendation]
- [Expected pillar %]
```

### Weekly Calendar
```
SEMANA: [Fecha]
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
LUNES: [Pilar X] - [Tema]
MARTES: [Pilar Y] - [Tema]
...
BALANCE:
Pilar 1: X posts
Pilar 2: Y posts
Pilar 3: Z posts
Pilar 4: W posts
```

---

## Error Handling

### If voice feels off:
→ Re-run through alexander-adapter with explicit instruction

### If pillar imbalance detected:
→ Load pillar-distributor.md, adjust calendar

### If content too salesy:
→ Revisit kreoon-showcase.md (80/20 rule)

### If faith content alienating:
→ Revisit faith-business-integration.md (balance explicit/implicit)

### If framework depth needed:
→ Consult knowledge/applied-frameworks.md, relevant section

